{"title":"Missouri mathematics competitions","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Missouri_elementary_school_mathematics_competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Missouri elementary school mathematics competitions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Missouri_middle_school_mathematics_competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Missouri middle school mathematics competitions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Missouri_high_school_mathematics_competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Missouri high school mathematics competitions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Missouri_college_mathematics_competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Missouri college mathematics competitions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#National_math_contests\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">National math contests</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Missouri_elementary_school_mathematics_competitions\">Missouri elementary school mathematics competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Missouri_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Missouri elementary school mathematics competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Missouri_Council_of_Teachers_of_Mathematics_Contests\" title=\"Missouri Council of Teachers of Mathematics Contests\">Missouri Council of Teachers of Mathematics Contests</a> for grades 4-12. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.moctm.org/Contests/contests.htm\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Southwest_Baptist_University&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Southwest Baptist University (page does not exist)\">Southwest Baptist University</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://users.sbuniv.edu/%7Ekhopkins/tourney.htm\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Barstow_Math_Contest&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Barstow Math Contest (page does not exist)\">Barstow Math Contest</a> for grades 4-8. It is hosted by The Barstow School. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.barstowschool.org/\">website</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Missouri_middle_school_mathematics_competitions\">Missouri middle school mathematics competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Missouri_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Missouri middle school mathematics competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AoPS\">AoPS</a> hosts <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/index.php?f=298\">middle school math forums</a> where students can discuss contest problems and mathematics.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Missouri_MathCounts&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Missouri MathCounts (page does not exist)\">Missouri MathCounts</a> is part of the national <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=MathCounts\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"MathCounts\">MathCounts</a> competition.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=College_of_the_Ozarks_Math_Competition&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"College of the Ozarks Math Competition (page does not exist)\">College of the Ozarks Math Competition</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.cofo.edu/math.asp?page=3\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Florissant_Valley_Excellence_in_Mathematics&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Florissant Valley Excellence in Mathematics (page does not exist)\">Florissant Valley Excellence in Mathematics</a> (grades 6-8)-changed from grades 6-9 in 2010</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Junior_High_Excellence_in_Mathematics_Contest&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Junior High Excellence in Mathematics Contest (page does not exist)\">Junior High Excellence in Mathematics Contest</a> -- grades 7-9. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.stlcc.cc.mo.us/fv/math/Excellence%20in%20Math%20Contest.htm\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Math_Field_Day_at_Southeast_Missouri_State_University&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Math Field Day at Southeast Missouri State University (page does not exist)\">Math Field Day at Southeast Missouri State University</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www5.semo.edu/math/mathfieldday.htm\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Missouri_Council_of_Teachers_of_Mathematics_Contests_for_grades_4-12\" title=\"Missouri Council of Teachers of Mathematics Contests for grades 4-12\">Missouri Council of Teachers of Mathematics Contests for grades 4-12</a>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.moctm.org/Contests/contests.htm\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Southwest_Baptist_University&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Southwest Baptist University (page does not exist)\">Southwest Baptist University</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://users.sbuniv.edu/%7Ekhopkins/tourney.htm\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Barstow_Math_Contest&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Barstow Math Contest (page does not exist)\">Barstow Math Contest</a> for grades 4-8. It is hosted by The Barstow School. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.barstowschool.org/\">website</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Missouri_high_school_mathematics_competitions\">Missouri high school mathematics competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Missouri_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Missouri high school mathematics competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AoPS\">AoPS</a> hosts <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/index.php?f=214\">high school math forums</a> where students can discuss contest problems and mathematics.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Missouri_ARML\" title=\"Missouri ARML\">Missouri ARML</a> competes at the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=American_Regions_Math_League\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"American Regions Math League\">American Regions Math League</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=College_of_the_Ozarks_Math_Competition&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"College of the Ozarks Math Competition (page does not exist)\">College of the Ozarks Math Competition</a>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.cofo.edu/math.asp?page=3\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Forest_Park_Excellence_in_Mathematics&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Forest Park Excellence in Mathematics (page does not exist)\">Forest Park Excellence in Mathematics</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.stlcc.edu/fp/math/contest/\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathleague.org\" title=\"Mathleague.org\">mathleague.org</a> -- Runs the state high school math championship in partnership with the Missouri Council of Teachers of Mathematics; visit the AoPS <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/index.php?f=315\">mathleague.org Forum</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Junior_High_Excellence_in_Mathematics_Contest&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Junior High Excellence in Mathematics Contest (page does not exist)\">Junior High Excellence in Mathematics Contest </a>-- grades 7-9. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.stlcc.cc.mo.us/fv/math/Excellence%20in%20Math%20Contest.htm\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Math_Field_Day_at_Southeast_Missouri_State_University&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Math Field Day at Southeast Missouri State University (page does not exist)\">Math Field Day at Southeast Missouri State University</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www5.semo.edu/math/mathfieldday.htm\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Missouri_Southern_Math_League&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Missouri Southern Math League (page does not exist)\">Missouri Southern Math League</a> for grades 9-12.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Missouri_Council_of_Teachers_of_Mathematics_Contests\" title=\"Missouri Council of Teachers of Mathematics Contests\">Missouri Council of Teachers of Mathematics Contests</a> for grades 4-12. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.moctm.org/Contests/contests.htm\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Pummill_Math_Relays&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Pummill Math Relays (page does not exist)\">Pummill Math Relays</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://math.smsu.edu/pummill.html\">website</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Missouri_college_mathematics_competitions\">Missouri college mathematics competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Missouri_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Missouri college mathematics competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Missouri_Collegiate_Mathematics_Competition&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Missouri Collegiate Mathematics Competition (page does not exist)\">Missouri Collegiate Mathematics Competition</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.math-cs.cmsu.edu/%7Ehchen/contest/\">website</a></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"National_math_contests\">National math contests</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Missouri_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: National math contests\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_United_States_elementary_school_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of United States elementary school mathematics competitions\">List of United States elementary school mathematics competitions</a> for national contests.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_United_States_middle_school_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of United States middle school mathematics competitions\">List of United States middle school mathematics competitions</a> for national contests.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_United_States_high_school_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of United States high school mathematics competitions\">List of United States high school mathematics competitions</a> for national contests.</li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Missouri_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of mathematics competitions\">List of mathematics competitions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competitions_resources\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competitions resources\">Mathematics competitions resources</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018072640\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.021 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.029 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 45/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:1415:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018072640 and revision id 125610. Ren